        "name": "How long does AI search optimisation take to produce results?",
        "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Initial AI citations can materialise within 1-3 months of implementing entity strategy, structured data, and citation development. Comprehensive AI visibility across all major platforms typically requires 3-6 months. The timeline is influenced by your existing online authority, the competitiveness of your sector in Reading, and the speed at which AI crawlers re-index your site following optimisation." }
